/T (Headquartered in Noida, India, HCL Technologies is a premier global technology company that combines decades of engineering expertise with modern digital agility. Since its founding in 1976, HCL has grown into a powerhouse with over 225,000 employees, focusing on "Supercharging Progress" for clients worldwide. The company distinguishes itself through its unique "Mode 1-2-3" strategy, which balances core IT services with high-growth digital platforms and products. This strategic mix allows HCL to offer holistic solutions in software, infrastructure, and engineering R&D, positioning it as a critical partner in the global digital economy.)
