<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Mar-16 to Mar-20: A period of aggressive expansion characterized by high Growth CAPEX \(peaked at 13,719 in Mar-20\) and rapid asset base growth. Post-Mar-20: A transition to a consolidation phase. Growth CAPEX turned negative \(e.g., -2,471 in Mar-21\), meaning the company is now harvesting assets and relying on the capacity previously built. Current Focus: Capital allocation is now primarily directed towards increasing Maintenance CAPEX \(up to 4,173 in Mar-24\) to sustain the existing, younger asset base. Conclusion: HCLTech has moved from a major asset modernization cycle to a focus on asset optimization and efficiency.)
/E (Mar-16 to Mar-20: A period of aggressive expansion characterized by high Growth CAPEX \(peaked at 13,719 in Mar-20\) and rapid asset base growth. Post-Mar-20: A transition to a consolidation phase. Growth CAPEX turned negative \(e.g., -2,471 in Mar-21\), meaning the company is now harvesting assets and relying on the capacity previously built. Current Focus: Capital allocation is now primarily directed towards increasing Maintenance CAPEX \(up to 4,173 in Mar-24\) to sustain the existing, younger asset base. Conclusion: HCLTech has moved from a major asset modernization cycle to a focus on asset optimization and efficiency.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
